    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Jul 2024 09:00:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从决定举办婚礼，开始准备。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从2023年10月到2024年5月。一路上有欣喜和期待，也有纠结和失落。</span></p><span></span><p><span>还好，重要的不是时间和地点，是你。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们在一起，就是完美的婚礼。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听我们的婚礼准备篇，希望对同样有计划的你有帮助。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌟</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期构成：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">03:25</a> 备婚开始 选择摄影摄像&amp;主持</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="899">14:59</a> 选择策划的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 化妆师&amp;婚纱 要纠结千万次</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1773">29:33</a> 婚礼的重要因素是有给力的队友</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌟</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎来信：你的倾诉或问题，都可能成为我们下一期回答的内容或灵感。无论你有什么想知道的，或者有什么想听我们探讨的，都欢迎通过私信告诉我。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌟</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵bgm：</span></p><span></span><p><span>reality</span></p><span></span><p><span>天天-余佳运</span></p><span></span><p><span>梦中的婚礼</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌟</span></p><span></span><p><span>找到我</span></p><span></span><p><span>🈴️📮：756991953@qq.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1735824145" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1735824145"><span>臻臻哥哥</span></a><span>/</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/5127263763" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/5127263763"><span>一只小春卷</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/555c05b3e58d1309a61e328d?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5ad54e2711be101f6c583fb3&amp;apptime=1720680923&amp;share_id=eeba1efe9292437a837f22502ce9d831" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/555c05b3e58d1309a61e328d?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5ad54e2711be101f6c583fb3&amp;apptime=1720680923&amp;share_id=eeba1efe9292437a837f22502ce9d831"><span>一只小春卷</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>豆音：</span><a href="https://www.douyin.com/user/MS4wLjABAAAAg